  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Kimetsu_No_Yaiba/BH_KNY_Headerv2.webp\" alt=\"BH_KNY_Header\" width=\"649\" height=\"209\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">我們為這個 Mod 包推出了全新的 Discord 伺服器！！！</span></strong></em><span>&nbsp;</span></h2>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/rdD969PFEZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Kimetsu_No_Yaiba/BH_KNY_Desc3.webp\" alt=\"Discord invite\" width=\"920\" height=\"99\"></a></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/rdD969PFEZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/859491152541122630?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=blue&link=https://discord.com/api/guilds/859491152541122630/widget.json\" alt=\"discord users\" width=\"178\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/kimetsu-no-yaiba-demon-slayer-mod-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/486883?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=rgb&color=#991113\" alt=\"CurseForge Downloads\" width=\"177\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/kimetsu-no-yaiba-demon-slayer-mod-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/v/486883?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=rgb\" alt=\"CurseForge Version\" width=\"329\" height=\"26\"></a><span><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Kimetsu_No_Yaiba/BH_KNY_Desc2v2.webp\" alt=\"Summary\" width=\"1106\" height=\"119\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><strong>本 Mod 包基於人氣漫畫與動畫</strong> &ldquo;</strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong><strong>鬼滅之刃</strong></strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>階級晉升</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">：從水之卯、水之寅、金之卯、金之寅、土之卯開始</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">數不盡的</span><strong><strong>沉浸式</strong> <strong>內容</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">我只說一句，如果你喜歡《鬼滅之刃》</span><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">和 Minecraft</span></em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，</span><strong><strong><em>這絕對是必下載的 Mod 包</em></strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong>。快來試試看並告訴我你的想法吧！祝遊玩愉快！</span></em></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span></em></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>你可以透過擊殺惡鬼 / 或製作日輪刀（Sun Sword）成為殺鬼人。<br></strong></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>日輪刀製成並拿在手上時，會隨機獲得其餘 7 或 8 種顏色（屬性）中的一種。</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>要成為惡鬼，你需要找到特殊礦石「無慘血礦」。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>想要獲得惡鬼力量包，你必須擊殺惡鬼來獲取它們的力量包！</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">需要幫助嗎？</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;| </span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">發現了 Bug？ | 想協助我修復 Mod 包？請在 Discord 上發送訊息！</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>我的 Discord 用戶名：</strong><em><span style=\"background-color:#ffcc00\">demslayer</span></em></strong></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Kimetsu_No_Yaiba/BH_KNY_Separator1.webp\" alt=\"BH_KNY_Separator1\" width=\"1433\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>沒有伺服器和朋友一起玩《鬼滅之刃》嗎？</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">點擊下方圖片，選擇方案 <em>(至少 3GB)</em>，使用優惠碼『<strong><strong>Slayer</strong></strong>』即可享受首月 <strong><strong><em>25%</em></strong></strong><strong><strong> 折扣</strong>。享受擁有屬於自己的伺服器吧！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fSlayer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Kimetsu_No_Yaiba/BH_KNY_Promo.webp\" alt=\"BH_KNY_Promo\" width=\"918\" height=\"164\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Kimetsu_No_Yaiba/BH_KNY_Separator1.webp\" alt=\"BH_KNY_Separator1\" width=\"1433\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><del style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>事項</strong><strong>來自原版 Mod 開發者</strong></del><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">&darr;</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按鍵設定</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">R：切換呼吸法或血鬼術</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">右鍵：使用呼吸法或血鬼術（需持有日輪刀或血鬼術道具）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">S + 跳躍：後退步</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">M：鬼殺隊斑紋（需完成進度）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">殺鬼人進程方法：請跟隨進度提示！</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">惡鬼方面：必須消耗血液，3 滴血液可使你升級一級</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（50 滴血液可達最高等級，但若持續消耗血液，你將獲得更多生命值！）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
